Reverts the elements-meta.ts hunk of helium/core/keyboard-shortcuts.patch (GPL-3.0, The Helium Authors): DevTools'
Select an Element (elements.toggle-element-search) is ⇧⌘C again, as in Chrome and Ardia 0.2.39, so the key stays in
DevTools instead of falling through to the app's Copy URL.

